            "verseId": "ISA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 4:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu tihalibaho omwirima hali omwisiki ogu akaba ali omu bujune. Omubiro byaira akagayisa ensi ya Zebuluuni n'ensi ya Nafutaali, baitu omu biro bya hanyuma aligifoora y'ekitiinisa baitu n'enyanja nseeri ya Yorudaani omu Galiraaya y'abaamahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'obusobozi bwona, amaliriire kukora ebi byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA atumireho Yakobbo, baitu obukwenda nibwija kuhikaho Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Isirairi boona, omuntu weena anyakwikara omu rubuga Samaliya, alimanya MUKAMA nkooku akozire kinu. Hati, nibeekuliiriza kandi nibeehemba nibagamba ngu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amaju ag'amatafaali gaseesekere baitu turaayombekamu ag'amabaale. Emiraba ey'emisikamooli ekatemwa yagwa, baitu omu kiikaro kyayo nitwija kugarramu emikogoto emirungi mali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, MUKAMA aimukize abazigu ab'okubarwanisa aleesire abanyanzigwa baabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasiriya aba Burugaizooba n'Abafirisiti aba Bugwaizooba beeteekaniize kuhwerekereza Isirairi. Habwokuba MUKAMA takahoirweho kiniga akyagoroire omukono afubire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Isirairi bakanga kweteera; MUKAMA ow'obusobozi bwona noobu yabafubiire, nabwo batamugarukeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo MUKAMA alicwera ha Isirairi omutwe n'omukira, itaagi ry'omukindo n'orubingo omu kiro kimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu omukuru kandi ow'ekitiinisa nugwo omutwe, kandi omurangi arukwegesa ebisuba nugwo omukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba abo abanyakwebembera abantu banu babahabisa, kandi abo abeebemberwa bahwerekerra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo MUKAMA atarukusiimira basigazi baabo, nikyo atarukuganyirra enfuuzi n'abafaakati baabo; habwokuba buli muntu tarukutiina Ruhanga kandi nkozi y'ebibi, kandi buli muntu naabiiha ebisuba. Ebi byona nibyo birukukwasa MUKAMA ekiniga, akaikara agoroire omukono afubire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba obubi bw'abantu nibwaka nk'omurro, nibucwekereza amakerre n'amahwa, nibwokya amajumba ag'ekibira, nigarugwamu ekiika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi ehiire habw'ekiniga kya Ruhanga ow'amahe, abantu nubo bali nk'enku ezinyakunagwa omu murro; busaho muntu n'omu arukuganyira mutaahi we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunsi yoona abantu nibakookooba kandi nibalya buli kyokulya eki bakasangire, baitu tibarukwiguta. Nibanyaga ebyokulya ebya ha mukono ogw'obumoso, baitu tibakuleka kurumwa enjara; nibakatura ebya ha mukono ogw'obulyo, baitu tibarukwiguta; buli omu naajunjubura enyama ya mutaahi we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manaase nalya ey'Efuraimu, Efuraimu nalya eya Manaase, kandi abo bombi nibarwanisa Yuda, habwebi byona, MUKAMA takahoirweho kiniga, akyagoroire omukono afubire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
